3. System Architecture

3.1 Functional Blocks

1. Sensor Layer

   * DHT11
   * Soil Moisture Sensor
   * LDR

2. Processing Layer

   * Arduino UNO

3. Control Layer

   * Relay Module
   * Solenoid Valve

4. User Interface Layer

   * Serial Monitor
   * Manual Override Push Button

5. Data Logging Layer

   * CSV Serial Output

---

3.2 System Workflow

1. Read sensor values.
2. Validate readings.
3. Compare soil moisture with threshold.
4. Activate irrigation if threshold crossed.
5. Log readings to serial output.
6. Allow manual override.
7. Repeat continuously.

