5. Calibration Methodology

5.1 Soil Moisture Sensor Calibration

Dry Calibration

Sensor exposed to air.

Observed values:

| Sample | Reading |
| ------ | ------- |
| 1      | 960     |
| 2      | 955     |
| 3      | 958     |

Average Dry Value:

958

---

Wet Calibration

Sensor immersed in water.

Observed values:

| Sample | Reading |
| ------ | ------- |
| 1      | 320     |
| 2      | 330     |
| 3      | 325     |

Average Wet Value:

325

---

### Threshold Selection

Threshold chosen:

```cpp
soilThreshold = 600;
```

This provided reliable switching between dry and wet soil conditions.

