# 10. Known Limitations

## Sensor Accuracy

DHT11 has limited precision.

Possible improvement:

DHT22 or BME280.

---

## Soil Corrosion

Resistive soil sensors degrade over time.

Possible improvement:

Capacitive Soil Moisture Sensor.

---

## No Cloud Connectivity

Current implementation uses local serial monitoring.

Possible improvement:

ESP8266 MQTT integration.

---

## Single Zone Irrigation

Only one irrigation channel supported.

Possible improvement:

Multi-zone relay control.

